<title>GREECE: GREECE TO AUCTION 100BLN DRS 5-YR BONDS NEXT WEEK.</title>
<headline>GREECE TO AUCTION 100BLN DRS 5-YR BONDS NEXT WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece will auction 100 billion drachmas worth of 5-year fixed coupon bonds, its first ever, next week, the finance ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>Deputy Finance Minister Nickos Christodoulakis told reporters today that Greece planned to raise about 300 billion drachmas worth of bonds, FRNs and fixed-rate bonds, next week.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
